cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the study protocol and exact repository commit used."
title: "Reconstruction-based representations for forecasting"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kumar"
    given-names: "Mohit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohitKumarRostock/Kernel_Affine_Hull_Koopman_Machine"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code and evidence for forecasting with reconstruction-based representations,
  including Kernel Affine Hull Machines, affine reconstruction, and
  kernel-weighted averaging. The experiments distinguish information retained
  by features, fitted prediction accuracy, and assumptions needed for
  prediction-risk bounds. Each study has its own protocol and evaluation data.
keywords:
  - forecasting
  - geometric representations
  - kernel methods
  - reproducibility
